    "uz-cyrl": "**Google** — Gmail, Drive, Sheets, Slides, Docs ва Calendar (Google орқали кириш).",
    ru: "**Google** — Gmail, Drive, Sheets, Slides, Docs и Calendar (вход через Google).",
    en: "**Google** — Gmail, Drive, Sheets, Slides, Docs and Calendar (Google sign-in).",
